P('The core sensor achieved AUC one in every held-out split. Nevertheless, original score prediction was worse than the nuisance-only baseline in cerebellum and RR-23 on average; hippocampal prediction improved. Bounded and nested-training-CV shrinkage results were retained for all deposits. The latter chose among correction strengths 0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75 and 1 using training-only leave-one-animal-out prediction, refitting preprocessing and loadings within every inner fold. Projection was excluded from the disjoint-sensor prediction comparison because its score includes outside-sensor response genes. Independent direct-count verification passed 1,533 checks, including target perturbation tests of reference independence and dense loading/prediction recalculations. Reliable within-resource collection discrimination therefore did not establish genome-wide nuisance loading transfer or biological recovery.')
H('Real-data attenuation is heterogeneous and uncertain',2)
match='anchor_OSD562_to_OSD562_FLT_recovery';same='OSD525_shared_HGC_anchor';cb='anchor_OSD561_to_OSD561_FLT_recovery';cross='anchor_OSD562_to_OSD525'
