P('All 16 high-gain configurations and 100 repetitions per configuration were retained. The amendment followed recognition that primary simulated gains were smaller than real gains; it is not a preregistered confirmatory benchmark. Both score operators exactly preserved b supported outside the sensors, while observed biological effect recovery still depended on nuisance transfer. This distinction remains visible in the table and figure, including unchanged-coupling failure of the bounded method.',blocks=supp)
